  "bio": "Jorge (Karde) is a masterful tattoo artist hailing from Vigo, Galicia, with a penchant for black & gray, illustrative, and dotwork styles. Clients continually praise him for maintaining an impeccable level of cleanliness in his practice, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for his artistry to unfold. At White Buddha Tattoo, Jorge's dedication to cleanliness goes hand-in-hand with his intricate designs, keeping clients returning and recommending his services.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n@eiragalerietattoo \nVIGO GALICIA\nCITAS Y CONSULTAS\nMD\n\n@eiragalerietattoo \nVIGO GALICIA\nCITAS Y CONSULTAS\nMD",
